'''Sleigh''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2024 Christmas Box]] in the [[Christmas Event 2024]].It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
It has a shiny green base color with a metallic red overall color on the blade and a golden patten to resemble a sleigh.

